<BaseLayout title="About — BulldogsManila" description="BulldogsManila is Jules’s living family notebook: a permanent home for the pack’s stories.">
  <article class="page-hero wrap prose-page"><p class="eyebrow">About this home</p><h1>The internet moves quickly. A family does not have to.</h1><p class="lede">BulldogsManila is Jules’s living notebook for Bacon, Beer, Bao Bao, and Bowser.</p><p>Social channels carry moments out into the world. This site keeps the full stories together: the funny routines, the quiet changes, the things worth remembering, and the particular texture of home.</p><h2>Made with care, sometimes with help</h2><p>The experiences and point of view are creator-led and true to this family. Some visuals or editing may be assisted by AI. That help is part of the making—not the source of the memories.</p><p>And because somebody always asks: Beer is the dog’s name.</p></article>
</BaseLayout>
